# Cline — Lens Design System Rules

Canonical entry
→ .lens-knowledge-base/AGENT_PRIMER.md (read first, every session)
→ .lens-knowledge-base/_ROUTER.md (task → file navigation)

Before any UI task
1) Read the primer
2) Route via the router
3) Declare sources consulted in every UI response

Key Lens differences (quick recall)
| Need          | Wrong                  | Correct Lens                        |
|---------------|------------------------|-------------------------------------|
| Container/Box | div, Box               | Container                           |
| Flex layout   | Flex, flex div         | Split (+ SplitSection for items)    |
| Grid layout   | Grid, grid div         | Arrange                             |
| Headings/text | h1, Heading, p, span   | Text size="heading-lg" htmlTag="h1" |
| Disabled      | disabled               | isDisabled                          |
| Loading       | loading                | hasLoader                           |
| Element type  | as="a"                 | htmlTag="a"                         |
| Ref           | ref={ref}              | refHandler={(r) => ref.current = r} |
| Button icons  | leftIcon/rightIcon     | iconBefore/iconAfter                |
| Icons         | raw SVG                | Icon icon={<SvgName />}             |

Styling rules
- className with Lens utilities: ALLOWED on wrappers; on Lens components: external spacing/grow/shrink/self only
- CSS modules with var(--lns-*) for wrappers/custom elements (never on Lens internals)
- style={{}}: NEVER
- Tailwind: NEVER

Never load
- .lens-knowledge-base/reference/styles-full.md
- .lens-knowledge-base/reference/components-full.md